193 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 152 0 R
/E (BLT maintainers today operate across at least four disconnected surfaces: GitHub activity, Slack coordination, BLT workflow signals, and leaderboard data. Understanding the current ecosystem state requires manually switching between these tools, and by the time a bottleneck is visible, it has often already slowed the pipeline. New contributors have no way to see at a glance where help is needed or where a contribution is stuck.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
